        ## Filing a good bug report

        Before you file, **search the board**. Duplicates get *closed*.

        - Say what you *expected* and what ~~broke~~ happened.
        - Paste the exact error in `backticks`.
        - Read the [triage guide](/docs/triage "Triage").

